      <h1>Mediterranean Diet</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Vegetables, olive oil, and fish — one of the most rigorously studied eating patterns for heart health.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="ghost-btn" href="/diets/">← Back to Diets</a>
